// BT-4001: a class-side `super` send in an Actor subclass's class method, at
// method level and inside a closure. The class overrides `class peek:`, so
// answering 101 (not 1) shows `super` skipped it for the superclass's.

Bt4001ClassSuperActorBase subclass: Bt4001ClassSuperActorChild

  class peek: x => x

  class run => super peek: 1

  class runAll => #(1, 2) collect: [:x | super peek: x]
